# Profood Manager App — environment template
#
# Copy to a local .env (gitignored) or set these in your CI / build
# environment. Create React App only exposes variables prefixed with
# REACT_APP_ to the build, and they are INLINED AT BUILD TIME — you must
# rebuild (`npm run build`) after changing any of them.

# REQUIRED. App key that authorizes the manager panel against the API.
# It must EXACTLY match the API's PROFOOD_APP_MANAGER_KEY value
# (see api-profood/.env). Without it, signin / signout / password-reset are
# rejected by the backend: UserController@signin compares the submitted
# app_key to PROFOOD_APP_MANAGER_KEY and only issues a token when they match.
REACT_APP_KEY=

# Optional. The API base URL is currently selected automatically by NODE_ENV
# in src/api/api.ts (production -> https://api.profood-app.com/api/), so this
# is not read today. Uncomment only if you refactor api.ts to read it.
# REACT_APP_API_URL=https://api.profood-app.com/api/
